@startuml

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Dashboard / External Observer" as O
participant "Node X HTTP API" as API
participant "Introspection Service" as I
participant "State Store" as S
participant "Peer Table" as P
participant "Topology Store" as T

loop Every polling interval
  O -> API: GET /api/introspection
  API -> I: build introspection snapshot
  I -> S: read state snapshot
  I -> P: read membership snapshot
  I -> T: read topology snapshot
  I --> API: introspection payload (read-only)
  API --> O: 200 OK + JSON
end

note over O,API
Observer path is read-only and orthogonal to cluster coordination.
No distributed-state mutation is triggered by polling.
end note

@enduml
